{"5013130":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Cellar Cleanup Simulator","steam_appid":5013130,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5013190],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“Becoming a true cellar master is not just about knowing the bottles.”<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious cellar awaits its new owner. However, anyone wishing to earn this legendary collection must pass the exact same test.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/514bcaabed65ad631ddfc873353505e6.poster.avif?t=1793636471\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/514bcaabed65ad631ddfc873353505e6.webm?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/514bcaabed65ad631ddfc873353505e6.mp4?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place thousands of bottles where they belong, restore the collection to its former glory, and earn your place as the new cellar master.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“Every Bottle Awaits Its Rightful Spot&quot;<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This chaos—seemingly insurmountable at first glance—gradually turns into a flawless collection with every correct placement. As the shelves fill up, the cellar regains its former splendor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/b7f1ec5bb727530f9736595502c6f4ea.poster.avif?t=1793636471\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/b7f1ec5bb727530f9736595502c6f4ea.webm?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/b7f1ec5bb727530f9736595502c6f4ea.mp4?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just organizing… It's rebuilding a masterpiece. Sometimes, the greatest reward is watching chaos slowly turn into tranquility.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“Every Completed Shelf Makes You Stronger”<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>Skill Points<\/strong> by completing shelves, unlock new abilities, and shape your own playstyle. But remember, every sip makes you a little more drunk.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/93c48add1ceda35ae32ca57603a4c969.poster.avif?t=1793636471\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/93c48add1ceda35ae32ca57603a4c969.webm?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/93c48add1ceda35ae32ca57603a4c969.mp4?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More power? Or keeping control? The choice is yours…<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“Power sometimes demands a price.”<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sip makes you stronger... But slowly takes away your control.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/eb2b15c2b56d969fdbc574309c870554.poster.avif?t=1793636471\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/eb2b15c2b56d969fdbc574309c870554.webm?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/eb2b15c2b56d969fdbc574309c870554.mp4?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you ready to pay the price?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“<strong>Every Bottle is Precious”<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry every bottle carefully with a realistic physics system. Because even a single mistake can be costly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/61489c2eea36eb893b596b0f80b59b73.poster.avif?t=1793636471\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/61489c2eea36eb893b596b0f80b59b73.webm?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/61489c2eea36eb893b596b0f80b59b73.mp4?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true cellar master is not just fast, but also careful.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧘 Relaxing gameplay<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍷 Organize hundreds of different bottles<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 Categorize bottles by their types<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏛️ Restore the cellar to its former glory<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📚 Upgrade your skills<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚶 Carry more, work faster<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍺 Manage the power of drunkenness<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥂 Strike a balance between power and control<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚖️ Realistic physics-based carrying<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Be careful not to break the bottles<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Aim for the highest score<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 Compete on online leaderboard<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“Becoming a true cellar master is not just about knowing the bottles.”<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious cellar awaits its new owner. However, anyone wishing to earn this legendary collection must pass the exact same test.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/514bcaabed65ad631ddfc873353505e6.poster.avif?t=1793636471\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/514bcaabed65ad631ddfc873353505e6.webm?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/514bcaabed65ad631ddfc873353505e6.mp4?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place thousands of bottles where they belong, restore the collection to its former glory, and earn your place as the new cellar master.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“Every Bottle Awaits Its Rightful Spot&quot;<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This chaos—seemingly insurmountable at first glance—gradually turns into a flawless collection with every correct placement. As the shelves fill up, the cellar regains its former splendor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/b7f1ec5bb727530f9736595502c6f4ea.poster.avif?t=1793636471\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/b7f1ec5bb727530f9736595502c6f4ea.webm?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/b7f1ec5bb727530f9736595502c6f4ea.mp4?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just organizing… It's rebuilding a masterpiece. Sometimes, the greatest reward is watching chaos slowly turn into tranquility.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“Every Completed Shelf Makes You Stronger”<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>Skill Points<\/strong> by completing shelves, unlock new abilities, and shape your own playstyle. But remember, every sip makes you a little more drunk.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/93c48add1ceda35ae32ca57603a4c969.poster.avif?t=1793636471\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/93c48add1ceda35ae32ca57603a4c969.webm?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/93c48add1ceda35ae32ca57603a4c969.mp4?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More power? Or keeping control? The choice is yours…<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“Power sometimes demands a price.”<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sip makes you stronger... But slowly takes away your control.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/eb2b15c2b56d969fdbc574309c870554.poster.avif?t=1793636471\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/eb2b15c2b56d969fdbc574309c870554.webm?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/eb2b15c2b56d969fdbc574309c870554.mp4?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you ready to pay the price?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“<strong>Every Bottle is Precious”<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry every bottle carefully with a realistic physics system. Because even a single mistake can be costly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/61489c2eea36eb893b596b0f80b59b73.poster.avif?t=1793636471\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/61489c2eea36eb893b596b0f80b59b73.webm?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/extras\/61489c2eea36eb893b596b0f80b59b73.mp4?t=1793636471\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true cellar master is not just fast, but also careful.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧘 Relaxing gameplay<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍷 Organize hundreds of different bottles<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 Categorize bottles by their types<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏛️ Restore the cellar to its former glory<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📚 Upgrade your skills<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚶 Carry more, work faster<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍺 Manage the power of drunkenness<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥂 Strike a balance between power and control<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚖️ Realistic physics-based carrying<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Be careful not to break the bottles<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Aim for the highest score<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 Compete on online leaderboard<\/p>","short_description":"Cellar Cleanup Simulator is a relaxing single-player simulation where you organize hundreds of bottles in a legendary cellar. Place bottles on shelves with realistic physics, upgrade skills, manage the power of drunkenness, and restore the cellar to its former glory.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Dutch, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/cf74b86612bb36a6a35c96cb4b466e8ca98be9fa\/header.jpg?t=1793636471","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/c6f1ffb2dec69373724fe62c522be77ea6ca182d\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793636471","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013130\/c6f1ffb2dec69373724fe62c522be77ea6ca182d\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793636471","website":"https:\/\/www.kikigames.fun\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7-4790k \/ AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 980 Ti 6GB \/ AMD Radeon RX 6500XT<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u